 n Late Night With Seth Meyers\n(NBC) and The Late Late Show with James Cord
 en (CBS).\n\nGondelman\nis the author of the essay collection Nice Try: Sto
 ries of Best\nIntentions and Mixed Results published September 2019 by Harp
 er\nPerennial. Since 2019\, he has been a regular panelist on NPR mainstay\
